      "general": {
        "abstract": "The Mullwitzkees is located in the Venediger Group in the core zone of the National Park\r\nHohe Tauern. The upper part of the glacier (outer Mullwitzkees) is oriented to the south.The lower part of the glacier, especially the tongue, is oriented to West-South-West.\r\n",
